# program spi_board  (156 image bytes)
# source: programs/spt/spi_board.spt
# pins: cs=uio0, mosi=uio1, miso=uio2, sck=uio3
# `always` invariants are checked in RTL simulation only, not on the board

test loopback_reads_back_what_it_sends
reset
drain 3
loop 00000900
cmds 
reply 1 200000 - ok
flush 0 2000 a53c817e
cmds e160706170627060f0e060706f7f
reply 1 200000 - ok
flush 0 2000 00ff

test reads_a_SPI_flash_JEDEC_ID
needs spi_flash SPI NOR flash on Pmod top row (CS uio0, MOSI uio1, MISO uio2, SCK uio3), e.g. Digilent Pmod SF3
reset
drain 3
loop 00000000
cmds 
reply 1 200000 - ok
flush 0 2000 ff20ba19
end
